Changes from the originals:

- mermaid-reference.md: removed the link to the canonical list on GitHub.
- xml-reference.md: removed the "Style reference" section, which linked to
  style-reference.md and mxfile.xsd on GitHub, and changed the notes saying
  the MCP servers add the label keys (labelPerimeter, the label gap,
  labelPlacement) to say they must be written by hand, since the draw.io CLI
  does not add them.

The parent SKILL.md is a Japanese translation of
plugins/claude-code/skills/drawio/SKILL.md from the same commit, with every
instruction that sends the user's information to outside services removed
(draw.io MCP create_diagram, app.diagrams.net URLs, and scripts/find-shapes.js,
which sends search terms) and these references bundled instead of fetched
from GitHub. shared/xml-essentials.md is inlined into it.
